MODULE: CursorTrimEntitledUnbudgetedTtl
TARGET: CursorTrimEntitled
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a retention-TTL trim is not accounted as a TTL trim, so it reads as an unentitled cursor trim
PERTURBS: RetentionTrim

--- FIND
    /\ ttlUsed' = ttlUsed + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, driftUsed, drifted, crashes, ViewVars>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, ttlUsed, driftUsed, drifted, crashes, ViewVars>>
--- END
